# SDM660/SDM636 family kernel configuration.
#
# No family-wide CONFIG_XNU_ switch is required yet. The ARMv8.0 override that
# matters for Kryo 260 (no PSTATE.PAN) is board-level because the shared arm64
# profile also builds ARMv8.2+ boards:
#
#   CONFIG_XNU_NATIVE_PAN=n
#
# That override lives in configs/whyred_defconfig.
